# Positioning

CelestineMD is an independent open-source Markdown notes app in Rust, **inspired by** Obsidian — not a clean-room rewrite or clone of Obsidian.

- Do not frame features or docs as “clean-room Obsidian reimplementation.”
- Do not unpack or copy proprietary Obsidian app binaries, ASAR, Electron sources, or UI assets.
- Prefer Celestine’s own design; vault/wikilink familiarity is inspiration, not product parity.
- See docs/INSPIRATION.md.
